{"version":1,"content":"<p>【遊戲正義 ✅】美國紐約州眾議員 Ritchie Torres 正式提出名為《玩家權益保障法案》（Power To The Players Act）的聯邦立法提案，擬授權美國聯邦貿易委員會（FTC）制定新監管法規，強制遊戲發行商給予消費者實質所有權而非僅是「可撤銷許可證」，並要求具連線機能的遊戲在官方伺服器停運前，必須主動提供離線模式或讓遊戲維持可運作狀態。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:59:12.433165+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:55:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T02:37:37.467235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:57:36.372877+00:00","content_hash":"0449520b0736d51c6fc3bea897b40099ab0ddfdf24a528bc7d7d22b275b4c354","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}